    <!-- ============================================================ -->
    <!-- Remarks                                                       -->
    <!-- ============================================================ -->

    <remark>
        <Remark owns="false">
            <content>Investigation comprised 5 boreholes (BH-1 through BH-5) and 2 out-of-boundary boreholes (BH-1-OUT, BH-2-OUT), totalling approximately 150 m of drilling. In-situ SPT testing performed throughout. Laboratory testing included Atterberg limits, particle size distribution, CBR, and compaction tests. Foundation system comprises 1,075 controlled modulus columns (CMC/rigid inclusions) across 13 load transfer platform zones.</content>
            <author xlink:href="#BA001"/>
            <author xlink:href="#BA002"/>
            <remarkDateTime frame="#ISO-8601" indeterminatePosition="unknown">2024-11-15</remarkDateTime>
        </Remark>
    </remark>

    <remark>
        <Remark owns="false">
            <content>Site geology comprises surficial aeolian sand overlying medium-dense to dense silty sand and sandy silt, with occasional gravel layers. Groundwater not encountered within the investigated depth. Foundation recommendations based on CMC rigid inclusion system with load transfer platform (LTP) of compacted granular fill.</content>
            <author xlink:href="#BA001"/>
            <remarkDateTime frame="#ISO-8601" indeterminatePosition="unknown">2024-11-15</remarkDateTime>
        </Remark>
    </remark>

